  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "中國建築史",
    "sub_ename": "HISTORY OF CHINESE ARCHITECTURE",
    "describe_ch": "中國歷史之久遠與幅員之廣大，造成中國傳統建築在基本上呈現多樣化之型式，本課程冀望透過對中國傳統建築之瞭解與分析,認識其背後所隱藏之思想觀念與人文思想。在建築類型上，有關民居、宮殿、城市、聚落、園林、陵墓等，本課程亦深入討論其特徵與特質。",
    "describe_eh": "Traditional Chinese architecture has derived numerous variation of styles in the history. This course is to help students to understand the underlying concept and humanity thoughts of traditional architecture through the analysis of Chinese architecture. The topics of typology of traditional Chinese architecture include civilian residenses, palaces,  cities, villages, gardens and mausoleums.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "對於中國建築史的發展過程與脈絡能夠有基本的認識與了解。",
      "describe_en": "Understand the history and development of Chinese architecture"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "經由對中國建築史的討論，瞭解建築史在建築設計與建築發展過程中的重要性，透過課程的訓練思考，掌握設計課程與建築史之間的關聯性與啟發性。",
      "describe_en": "Through the discussion in the class, understand the importance how architecture history is connected and inspired the architecture design ."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "經由對中國建築的研究，學習如何掌握傳統語彙、空間模式與空間關係運用於規劃設計之構思中。",
      "describe_en": "Through the study of Chinese architecture history understand how to use the traditional Chinese architectural language, space, form, structure and pattern."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "透過建築文獻及相關人文書籍的深入閱讀，建立建築環境之人文價值與深層內涵。",
      "describe_en": "Through the traditional documentation and relevant books study, build up the ."
    },
    {
      "seq": 5,
      "describe_ch": "藉由東、西方傳統建築之比較分析，確立本土文化定位，並培養學生具國際觀之文化視野。",
      "describe_en": "Through the analysis between eastern and western traditional architecture, understand the importance of locality and influence of globalization."
    },
    {
      "seq": 6,
      "describe_ch": "由閱讀圖說及模型製作，充分認識中國建築特有之木構造形式與工法，並學習傳統建築之圖說特殊表現技巧。",
      "describe_en": "Through the study of documentation and model making, understand the form and construction of traditional Chinese wood structure as well as the traditional Chinese architecture presentation."
    },
    {
      "seq": 7,
      "describe_ch": "經由分組案例研究報告，對於屬於傳統建築的作品都能提出一套屬於自己的評論與分析的方法，並且透過學期報告來展現自身對建築的觀察能力。",
      "describe_en": " Final report is divided into groups. Every group has to analyze and critic the traditional Chinese architecture. Through the report, student has to be able to express the observation and research of traditional Chinese architecture ."
    }
  ],
